rameter are propagated into an explicit isotropic matrix penalty. In the deterministic drift replay all true propensities lie in the simultaneous intervals, dynamic weighting outperforms a frozen initial propensity model, the covariance change is detected, and the final PSD upper model still yields a valid whitener and positive selector separation."}
